&oh=00_AQTWW81zcPA51Jobw7douX3uZ_4dws8lmgmS6PTCi8yBXw&oe=6AEF62ED"}, {"file_name": "ApplicationFrameHost_w2gA8rmjnH_16x9.png", "id": "1076269148371312", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604385997_1076269155037978_773783658790453776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=u87ZwD3nm8MQ7kNvwHvTuQh&_nc_oc=Adr5A_awPtQKNM4LN8rf0YNJNxMjk-9Y0eawuTrkS248TkO0wQibdFJvHCu5oftakPo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRDLkdnKgUIOsTiHZiOq7LjpqnbzNfsDQjxadCk1TM-Dw&oe=6AEF511F"}, {"file_name": "ApplicationFrameHost_WJg5wom5YU_16x9.png", "id": "1839101883739871", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673573223_1839101887073204_1369626186002792851_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Gk39CYDs-DYQ7kNvwHEoTXH&_nc_oc=AdqqjXizy6ZmlOwgqWQ0OfuMoG6QKZAIioF5nJ7ruJu1v2vK6EGNALTtPFqdIeqXszw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQStM3pmCtHPYepDeafJBdVdRWHKCaXUYM5xEWo0e-RUtg&oe=6AEF4544"}, {"file_name": "ApplicationFrameHost_ho5YNaQE9r_16x9 (1).png", "id": "1627886348715787", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595119480_1627886352049120_8054576045411958904_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8ikTEySvTb0Q7kNvwEY6ZtV&_nc_oc=AdrvZU8RLqP3lIkyHKt3JWfpULcS6t19BshxUQUy_gERRlBiHP0C-0lrzRPXifYIYUE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSos5udDPJzf8doihHbfj-qE4Jf6YOPh-v8JCkRnn0LJg&oe=6AEF34D6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "officialtrailer (1).png", "id": "1410773183811260", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/596168449_1410773187144593_6502129704163225488_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CC81d7yjEIwQ7kNvwFC1u_3&_nc_oc=AdqVvlQK8L95h-FMVHzXfTvrmfGl_Ze7glB32Ycs3IAeeU_GwUlQKlH-uXJAfJdtC_Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRCyV1khD-uiy8sOz390QzXm8eu7R2i8kCIqwbG4BazMg&oe=6AEF5F28"}, "display_name": "UluP Spatial", "keywords": ["productivity", "projects", "mixedreality", "handtracking", "collaboration"], "long_description": "UluP Spatial brings your UluP Spaces project map into mixed reality on Quest. Instead of a flat canvas on a screen, your project's nodes float around you as real 3D objects you grab, move and connect with your own hands.\n\n**What you can do:**\n- See your real projects and nodes, synced live from your UluP Spaces account\n- Grab and reposition nodes with hand tracking or controllers\n- Open a node to view and check off tasks, add new ones by voice or virtual keyboard\n- Draw connections between nodes to map how your ideas relate\n- Focus on a single task with notes and a built-in timer\n- View image and file attachments directly in the scene\n- Work on the same project together with a collaborator, in real time \u2014 see who's online and what they're working on\n- Switch between AR (passthrough, your real room) and full VR\n\nUluP Spatial uses the same account and the same projects as UluP Spaces (web/desktop) \u2014 nothing to set up twice, nothing duplicated. Sign in and your projects are already there, including any automation you've built with UluP SDK Studio (build one yourself, or import a ready-made one from the community template library \u2014 just talk to Claude to create one via MCP).", "short_description": "Your project map, in mixed reality. Grab nodes, connect ideas, manage tasks with your hands \u2014 synced live with your UluP Spaces account."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ulupstudio.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.ulupstudio.com/privacy", "publisher_name": "UluP Studio", "support_website_url": "https://www.ulupstudio.com/support", "website_url": "https://www.ulupstudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1063584910